{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/molecular-genetics/","source":"students/subjects/biology/genetics/molecular-genetics.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Molecular Genetics | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Genetics &amp; Evolution</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Molecular Genetics</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding DNA, genes, and mutations at a basic level</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand the basic structure of DNA</li>\n                        <li>• Explain how genes carry information</li>\n                        <li>• Describe different types of mutations</li>\n                        <li>• Recognize the importance of genetic information</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"DNA and Genes Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: DNA Structure</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">The blueprint of life explained simply</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Genes and Traits</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">How DNA determines characteristics</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. DNA Basics</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• DNA structure:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Double helix shape</li>\n                                    <li>- Base pairs (A-T, G-C)</li>\n                                    <li>- Sugar-phosphate backbone</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• DNA function:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Genetic information storage</li>\n                                    <li>- Passing traits to offspring</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• DNA location:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Cell nucleus</li>\n                                    <li>- Chromosomes</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Genes and Alleles</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• What are genes?\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Units of inheritance</li>\n                                    <li>- Instructions for traits</li>\n                                    <li>- Sections of DNA</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Alleles:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Different versions of genes</li>\n                                    <li>- Trait variations</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Gene expression:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Making proteins</li>\n                                    <li>- Controlling traits</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Mutations</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• What are mutations?\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Changes in DNA</li>\n                                    <li>- Random occurrences</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Types of mutations:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Substitutions</li>\n                                    <li>- Insertions</li>\n                                    <li>- Deletions</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Effects of mutations:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Harmful changes</li>\n                                    <li>- Neutral changes</li>\n                                    <li>- Beneficial changes</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Genetic Code Basics</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• DNA language:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Four-letter alphabet (A,T,G,C)</li>\n                                    <li>- Gene instructions</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• From genes to traits:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Making proteins</li>\n                                    <li>- Building bodies</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Universal code:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Same in all living things</li>\n                                    <li>- Evolution evidence</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">DNA Model Building</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Simple DNA models</li>\n                                <li>• Base pair matching</li>\n                                <li>• Double helix structure</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Trait Investigation</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Family trait patterns</li>\n                                <li>• Gene expression examples</li>\n                                <li>• Mutation effects</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Describe the basic structure of DNA.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include the main components and their arrangement.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Explain how genes determine our traits.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Use a simple example like eye color.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Describe different types of mutations.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include their potential effects on organisms.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}